{"seq":2,"slug":"trajectory-planning","title":"轨迹规划与避障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/trajectory-planning","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"轨迹规划与避障\">轨迹规划与避障</h1><p><a href=\"kinematics-ik\">运动学与逆运动学</a>能算出&quot;到达某个抓取位姿需要哪些关节角&quot;，但抓取不是瞬移——机械臂得从当前位置一路无碰地走到目标，途中绕开桌面、料箱壁、其他物体，甚至自己的连杆。轨迹规划负责生成这条路径并配上时间，让运动既无碰撞又平滑可执行。它处在 IK 之后、控制器之前，是抓取动作的&quot;导航系统&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要区分两个常被混用的词：**路径（path）**是空间中的几何曲线（走哪条线），**轨迹（trajectory）<strong>是路径加上时间参数（什么时候走到哪，含速度加速度）。规划通常分两步：先在</strong>构型空间（C-space）**中搜出无碰路径，再做时间参数化使其满足速度/加速度/力矩限制。构型空间把机械臂的每组关节角看成一个点，障碍物在其中映射为禁区。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[起点 + 目标关节角] --&gt; B[构型空间 C-space 建模]&#10;    B --&gt; C{规划方法}&#10;    C --&gt; D[采样法 RRT/PRM]&#10;    C --&gt; E[优化法 CHOMP/TrajOpt]&#10;    D --&gt; F[无碰路径]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[时间参数化&lt;br/&gt;满足速度/加速度限]&#10;    G --&gt; H[平滑轨迹]&#10;    H --&gt; I[关节控制器执行]\">flowchart TD\n    A[起点 + 目标关节角] --&gt; B[构型空间 C-space 建模]\n    B --&gt; C{规划方法}\n    C --&gt; D[采样法 RRT/PRM]\n    C --&gt; E[优化法 CHOMP/TrajOpt]\n    D --&gt; F[无碰路径]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[时间参数化&lt;br/&gt;满足速度/加速度限]\n    G --&gt; H[平滑轨迹]\n    H --&gt; I[关节控制器执行]</pre><p>下表对比两大类规划方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>代表算法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样法</td>\n<td>RRT、RRT*、PRM</td>\n<td>随机采样构型连成图/树</td>\n<td>高维有效、概率完备</td>\n<td>路径不平滑、需后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化法</td>\n<td>CHOMP、TrajOpt、STOMP</td>\n<td>把轨迹当变量做优化</td>\n<td>直接出平滑轨迹</td>\n<td>易陷局部最优、需好初值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析法</td>\n<td>多项式/样条插值</td>\n<td>关节空间直接插值</td>\n<td>简单快速</td>\n<td>不处理复杂障碍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"构型空间与碰撞检测\">构型空间与碰撞检测</h2><p>规划的舞台是构型空间：一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 自由度机械臂的每个状态是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 维向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，整个空间记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。会碰撞的构型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{C}_{obs}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0583em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是禁区，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{C}_{free}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0583em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可行区。规划就是在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{C}_{free}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0583em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中找一条连接起点与终点的连续曲线。</p>\n<p>难点在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{C}_{obs}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0583em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0583em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 无法显式算出——障碍物在笛卡尔空间好描述，但映射到关节空间形状极其复杂。因此实践中不构造禁区，而是<strong>按需碰撞检测</strong>：给定一个候选构型，用正运动学算出各连杆位姿，再做几何相交测试（连杆与障碍、连杆与连杆）。碰撞检测是规划的性能瓶颈，常用层次包围盒（如 FCL 库的 BVH）加速。检测频率与路径密度的权衡是工程关键——查得太稀会漏穿障碍，太密则拖慢规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样法-rrt-与-prm\">采样法：RRT 与 PRM</h2><p>高维构型空间无法网格穷举，采样法成为主流。**快速扩展随机树（RRT）**从起点长一棵树：反复随机采样一个构型，从树上最近节点朝它生长一小步，若这一步无碰则加入树，直到树触及目标。RRT 概率完备——只要解存在，采样足够多必能找到。其变体 <strong>RRT*</strong> 在生长时重连邻域以渐近最优，路径更短。</p>\n<p>**概率路标图（PRM）**适合多次查询：预先在自由空间撒大量点、连接近邻成图，之后每次查询只需把起终点接入图再搜最短路。RRT 适合单次查询（每次目标不同的抓取），PRM 适合固定环境反复规划。两者的代价都是路径锯齿状、不直接可执行，必须经平滑后处理（如路径捷径化 shortcutting）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>查询模式</th>\n<th>最优性</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RRT</td>\n<td>单次查询</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>抓取（每次目标变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRT*</td>\n<td>单次查询</td>\n<td>渐近最优</td>\n<td>需短路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PRM</td>\n<td>多次查询</td>\n<td>图内最优</td>\n<td>固定环境反复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIT*</td>\n<td>单次查询</td>\n<td>渐近最优、高效</td>\n<td>高维复杂场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优化法与时间参数化\">优化法与时间参数化</h2><p>采样法找到的路径往往别扭，优化法则直接把&quot;平滑、无碰、短&quot;写成目标函数对整条轨迹优化。<strong>CHOMP</strong> 用协变梯度下降，目标含平滑项（惩罚加速度）与障碍项（惩罚靠近障碍）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>ξ</mi></munder><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ξ</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\xi}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\!\\int \\|\\ddot{\\xi}(t)\\|^2 dt + \\lambda \\int c_{obs}(\\xi(t))\\, dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2482em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>TrajOpt</strong> 用序列凸优化把碰撞约束写成不等式；<strong>STOMP</strong> 用无梯度的随机采样优化，适合不可微代价。优化法直接输出平滑轨迹，但依赖好初值、易陷局部最优，工程上常以采样法的解作初值，再用优化法精修——两者互补。</p>\n<p>无论哪种方法得到几何路径，还要做<strong>时间参数化</strong>：在路径上分配时间，使速度、加速度、关节力矩都不超限。经典的时间最优参数化（TOPP）在路径约束下求最快通过时间，梯形或 S 形速度曲线则在简单场景保证平滑启停。时间参数化的输出——带时刻的关节位置序列——才是控制器真正执行的轨迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与抓取动作的衔接\">与抓取动作的衔接</h2><p>轨迹规划在抓取流程中承上启下：上游<a href=\"kinematics-ik\">运动学与逆运动学</a>给出目标关节角（及多解约束），它生成无碰路径；下游若涉及接触（贴近物体、插入），刚性轨迹跟踪会变得危险，须切换到<a href=\"force-compliant-control\">力控与柔顺控制</a>。一个完整的抓取动作通常分段：自由空间用轨迹规划快速接近，接近接触时降速并切换柔顺。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[当前构型] --&gt; B[预抓取位姿 IK]&#10;    B --&gt; C[自由空间 RRT 规划]&#10;    C --&gt; D[平滑 + 时间参数化]&#10;    D --&gt; E[快速接近]&#10;    E --&gt; F[接触前降速]&#10;    F --&gt; G[切换力控/柔顺]&#10;    G --&gt; H[闭合夹爪抓取]&#10;    H --&gt; I[规划提起+搬运路径]\">flowchart TD\n    A[当前构型] --&gt; B[预抓取位姿 IK]\n    B --&gt; C[自由空间 RRT 规划]\n    C --&gt; D[平滑 + 时间参数化]\n    D --&gt; E[快速接近]\n    E --&gt; F[接触前降速]\n    F --&gt; G[切换力控/柔顺]\n    G --&gt; H[闭合夹爪抓取]\n    H --&gt; I[规划提起+搬运路径]</pre><p>值得注意的是，端到端学习方法（<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/imitation-learning\">模仿学习</a>、<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/rl-grasping\">强化学习抓取策略</a>、<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/vla-models\">VLA 模型</a>）正越来越多地直接从感知输出动作序列，隐式完成了规划与避障——但在安全关键、需可验证的工业场景，显式轨迹规划因其可解释和可保证仍是主流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路径是几何曲线，轨迹是路径加时间；规划先在构型空间搜无碰路径，再时间参数化满足动力学限制。</li>\n<li>构型空间的障碍区无法显式构造，实践用按需碰撞检测（正运动学 + 几何相交），它是性能瓶颈。</li>\n<li>采样法（RRT/RRT*/PRM）概率完备、适合高维，但路径需平滑；RRT 用于单次查询，PRM 用于固定环境多次查询。</li>\n<li>优化法（CHOMP/TrajOpt/STOMP）直接出平滑轨迹但易陷局部最优，常用采样解作初值；时间参数化（TOPP/S 曲线）产出可执行轨迹。</li>\n<li>规划承接<a href=\"kinematics-ik\">运动学</a>的目标关节角，接触阶段让位于<a href=\"force-compliant-control\">力控与柔顺控制</a>，并正被<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/\">学习驱动方法</a>隐式吸收。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"轨迹规划与避障","id":"轨迹规划与避障"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构型空间与碰撞检测","id":"构型空间与碰撞检测"},{"level":2,"text":"采样法：RRT 与 PRM","id":"采样法-rrt-与-prm"},{"level":2,"text":"优化法与时间参数化","id":"优化法与时间参数化"},{"level":2,"text":"与抓取动作的衔接","id":"与抓取动作的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运动学与逆运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/kinematics-ik"},"next":{"title":"力控与柔顺控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/force-compliant-control"}}